  "description": "The VersaTul Collection Streamers provides functionality that enables developers to quickly convert a collection of objects in memory into a data-reader that can be used for Bulk inserting data into a SQL Database, or be used to generate flat files. \n\t\t\tDevelopers can use the streamers to:\n\n\t\t\t1. Convert a Collection to a Data-Reader.\n\t\t\t2. Convert from a Data-Reader to other file formats such as CSV, TAB or Json.\n\t\t\t3. Compress converted data into Zip files.\n\t\t\t4. Transport the converted data via e-mail.\n\n\t\t\tThe Streamers project also works with Display Attributes which is used to manipulate the properties on the objects in the collection such as formatting the data or renaming the property with a desired display name.",
